{"id":8981,"date":"2024-07-27T07:00:00","date_gmt":"2024-07-27T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=8981"},"modified":"2026-05-27T06:57:15","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T06:57:15","slug":"when-should-my-homes-windows-be-replaced","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/when-should-my-homes-windows-be-replaced\/","title":{"rendered":"When Should My Home&#8217;s Windows Be Replaced?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Windows are integral to your home&#8217;s energy efficiency, security, and comfort. Recognizing the right time to replace them can yield significant savings on heating and cooling expenses, elevate your property&#8217;s value, and enhance your daily living experience. In this blog, we&#8217;ll delve into the indicators signaling the need for window replacement, highlight its manifold benefits, and provide expert guidance on evaluating your current windows. Moreover, for comprehensive renovation projects, consider <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\" title=\"\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a> as your trusted partner, offering professional solutions to elevate your home to new heights of excellence.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/worker-hand-removing-old-window-replacing-the-old-2023-11-27-04-57-39-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"window replacement\" class=\"wp-image-8984\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Signs You Need New Windows<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Whether it&#8217;s now or next month, look out for the following five signs that windows in your home are in need of replacement. If your windows are more than a few decades old, listen carefully to what they tell you to know when they need to be replaced.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Frequent Drafts and Poor Insulation<\/strong> If your home is particularly hot when the windows are closed, they may need to be replaced. Drafty windows can significantly impact your home\u2019s temperature regulation, making your HVAC system work harder and increasing your energy bills.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Condensation and Moisture Buildup<\/strong> If you notice condensation build up between panes or moisture that you can\u2019t remove from the glass panels, it\u2019s probably time to replace your windows. This often indicates that the seals are failing, allowing moisture to infiltrate.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Visible Damage and Decay<\/strong> Damaged window frames and panes are clear indicators that replacement is necessary. Twisted, cracked, or warped frames compromise your window\u2019s integrity and effectiveness.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Excessive Noise from Outside<\/strong> New energy-efficient windows help absorb sound waves before they enter your home. If you hear the wind whine on a stormy night or are frequently disturbed by outside noise, it may be time to upgrade.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>High Energy Bills<\/strong> Replacing your windows with energy-efficient options can help lower your heating and cooling costs, saving you money every month. Windows containing argon and low emissivity (LoE) glass are excellent for improving insulation and reducing energy loss.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exploring Window Replacement Options<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When it comes to replacing your windows, you&#8217;ll have a variety of options to choose from, including different materials, styles, and features. Here&#8217;s an overview of some common window replacement options:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vinyl Windows: <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Vinyl windows are a popular choice due to their affordability, low maintenance requirements, and energy efficiency. They come in a wide range of styles and colors to complement any home&#8217;s aesthetic.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wood Windows: <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Wood windows offer a classic look and natural warmth that many homeowners find appealing. While they require more maintenance than vinyl or aluminum windows, they can be painted or stained to match your home&#8217;s decor.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Aluminum Windows: <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Aluminum windows are durable, lightweight, and resistant to corrosion, making them ideal for homes in coastal areas or regions with harsh weather conditions. They are also highly customizable and available in a variety of finishes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fiberglass Windows: <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fiberglass windows are known for their strength, durability, and energy efficiency. They are resistant to warping, rotting, and swelling, making them a low-maintenance option for homeowners.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Composite Windows: <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Composite windows combine the benefits of different materials, such as wood fibers and PVC, to create a strong, weather-resistant window frame. They offer the look of wood with the durability of vinyl or fiberglass.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Energy-Efficient Windows: <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Many modern windows come with energy-efficient features such as double or triple glazing, low-emissivity (Low-E) coatings, and insulated frames. These features help reduce heat loss, minimize condensation, and lower energy bills.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/professional-master-at-repair-and-installation-of-2023-11-30-21-48-50-utc-1024x681.jpg\" alt=\"window replacement by a professional\" class=\"wp-image-8990\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Window Lifespan Expectations<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Items that are in good condition can last over 20 years, but as windows approach two decades, it&#8217;s time to consider replacing them. Here\u2019s a brief overview of the lifespan of different window materials:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Vinyl Windows<\/strong>: Typically last between 20 to 40 years.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Wood Windows<\/strong>: Can last up to 30 years with proper maintenance.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Aluminum Windows<\/strong>: Generally last about 20 to 25 years.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Fiberglass Windows<\/strong>: Known for their durability, can last up to 50 years.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Benefits of Replacing Your Windows<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Energy Efficiency<\/strong> New windows provide better insulation, reducing the strain on your HVAC system and lowering energy bills. Energy-efficient replacement windows can help lower your heating and cooling costs, saving you money every month.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Enhanced Security<\/strong> Replacing windows can also increase the security of your home with stronger glass and improved locking systems. This is particularly important for homes in areas like Bend, OR and Redmond, OR, where weather conditions and security concerns may vary.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Improved Comfort<\/strong> Drafty windows can make your home uncomfortable. Upgrading to new windows can eliminate drafts and make your living spaces more comfortable year-round.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Noise Reduction<\/strong> New energy-efficient windows help absorb sound waves before they enter your home, creating a quieter indoor environment.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When to Replace Windows<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From a money-saving standpoint, a complete home window replacement is rarely worth the cost, although it does depend on whether extensive work is required to repair the old windows. Home improvement projects are expensive and time-consuming, so it&#8217;s easy to put off replacing windows until they&#8217;re completely needed.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Around the 15-Year Mark<\/strong>: Once you&#8217;ve reached the 15-year milestone with windows, it&#8217;s time to think and consider replacing them.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Extensive Repairs Needed<\/strong>: If you find that there is an easy solution, or that the only solution is to completely replace the window, then replacement might be necessary.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Assessing Window Replacement Needs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Determining whether your windows need replacing is very important, and there are plenty of signs around your home that will clearly tell you that it&#8217;s time to start a window renovation program. Here\u2019s how to assess:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Professional Inspection<\/strong>: Call a professional for an in-depth inspection. They can provide a detailed assessment of your windows&#8217; condition.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>DIY Inspection<\/strong>: Check for visible signs of damage, test for drafts using a candle or incense stick, and inspect the frames for rot or decay.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/quality-light-construction-workers-installing-new-2023-11-27-05-19-24-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Window repairing work\" class=\"wp-image-8992\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Planning Your Window Replacement Project<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before embarking on a window replacement project, it&#8217;s essential to plan carefully and consider the following factors:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Budget<\/strong>: Determine your budget for the project, taking into account the cost of materials, installation, and any additional features or upgrades you may want.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Style and Design<\/strong>: Choose window styles and designs that complement your home&#8217;s architecture and enhance its curb appeal. Consider factors such as window size, shape, grid patterns, and hardware finishes.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Energy Efficiency<\/strong>: Select windows with energy-efficient features that can help reduce heating and cooling costs and improve indoor comfort. Look for ENERGY STAR\u00ae certified windows and consider options such as double or triple glazing, low-E coatings, and insulated frames.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Professional Installation<\/strong>: Hire a reputable window contractor with experience in window replacement projects. Ensure they are licensed, insured, and have positive reviews from past customers. A professional installation is crucial for ensuring your new windows perform optimally and last for years to come.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Permits and Regulations<\/strong>: Check local building codes and regulations to determine if permits are required for your window replacement project. Your contractor can help obtain the necessary permits and ensure compliance with local regulations.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Timeline<\/strong>: Establish a timeline for your window replacement project, taking into account factors such as lead times for ordering windows, scheduling installation, and any potential weather-related delays.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Knowing when to replace your windows can help you save money in the long run because your home will be better insulated. Whether you live in Portland, OR, or Happy Valley, OR, understanding the signs of window damage and deterioration can help you make informed decisions about window replacements. If you\u2019re noticing drafts, moisture buildup, or increased energy bills, it might be time to invest in new windows. Call <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/a> at <a href=\"tel:3602166078\" data-type=\"tel\" data-id=\"tel:3602166078\"><\/a><a title=\"\" href=\"tel:+15413165836\">+1 541-316-5836<\/a> if you need a window renovation consultation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Replacing your windows not only improves your home&#8217;s energy efficiency and comfort but also enhances its overall value and security. Stay proactive about window maintenance to ensure your home remains in top condition.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contact <a href=\"https:\/\/share.google\/gwM2ovux57i85a4fn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Harris and Sons<\/a> for a quote!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Windows are integral to your home&#8217;s energy efficiency, security, and comfort. Recognizing the right time to replace them can yield significant savings on heating and cooling expenses, elevate your property&#8217;s value, and enhance your daily living experience. In this blog, we&#8217;ll delve into the indicators signaling the need for window replacement, highlight its manifold benefits, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":8989,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[33],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-8981","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-remodeling-tips"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8981","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=8981"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8981\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":16298,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/8981\/revisions\/16298"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=8981"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=8981"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=8981"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}